{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t印度東部加爾各答發生人踩人，最少17人死亡、25人受傷。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n當地傳媒報道，現場是加爾各答一處宗教節慶活動，當地星期六晚突然下大雨，導致民眾湧向臨時搭建的活動場地出口處，引發人踩人。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n報道引述目擊者表示，場地出入口非常狹窄、而且沒有充足照明。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方說，遇難者包括兒童，已經封鎖事發場地調查。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T22:39:06.579251+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T22:19:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T01:17:34.633100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T22:37:34.122141+00:00","content_hash":"5837decf551e973a2fa693721e8e832c9925822e17441beff442cec951df4692","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}